  "description": "Background dispatcher for the HoneyDrunk.Data transactional outbox. Polls pending messages and publishes them through HoneyDrunk.Transport abstractions with lease-based concurrency, configurable retry, and exponential backoff. Adapter-agnostic — references no specific message bus.",
